sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (browser)
    participant DB as Dashboard (Next.js server)
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant PG as Supabase Postgres

    U->>DB: Install on GitHub
    DB-->>U: redirect to github.com/apps/code-sentinel-mvp/installations/new?state=… (state kept in an httpOnly cookie)
    U->>GH: choose account and repositories, install
    GH-->>U: redirect to /onboarding/github/callback?code=…&state=…&installation_id=…
    U->>DB: callback
    DB->>DB: state matches the cookie (otherwise ask the user to confirm, never use the code)
    DB->>GW: POST /v1/github/link { code } with the Supabase bearer token
    GW->>GH: exchange code (App client ID + secret)
    GH-->>GW: user token (8 h) + refresh token (6 months)
    GW->>GH: GET /user
    GW->>PG: users.github_user_id / github_login (one GitHub account per user)
    GW->>PG: github_user_tokens, sealed with AES-256-GCM

    loop every installation the user can reach (GET /user/installations)
        GW->>PG: upsert organization (by GitHub id) and installation
        GW->>GH: GET /installation/repositories (as the App)
        GW->>PG: upsert repositories by GitHub id, mark the missing ones removed
        GW->>GH: GET /user/memberships/orgs/{org}
        GW->>PG: organization_members: admin of own account, otherwise GitHub's role
    end
    GW-->>DB: 200 { githubLogin, installations }
    DB-->>U: /repositories with "N repositories are ready"

    Note over GH,PG: Later changes arrive as webhooks, handled as the App
    GH->>GW: installation / installation_repositories (signed)
    GW->>PG: sync, or mark uninstalled / suspended / removed (history kept)
    GW-->>GH: 202 installation_synced
